WEBVTT

00:00:57.882 --> 00:01:00.414
And I could not disagree more.

00:01:00.438 --> 00:01:01.725
In addition,

00:01:01.749 --> 00:01:05.700
I believe that every oiled animal
deserves a second chance at life.

00:01:05.724 --> 00:01:08.752
And I want to tell you why
I feel so strongly about this.

00:01:09.204 --> 00:01:11.237
On June 23, 2000,

00:01:11.261 --> 00:01:15.151
a ship named the Treasure sank
off the coast of Cape Town, South Africa,

00:01:15.175 --> 00:01:17.563
spilling 1,300 tons of fuel,

00:01:17.587 --> 00:01:23.023
which polluted the habitats
of nearly half the entire world population

00:01:23.047 --> 00:01:24.624
of African penguins.

00:01:25.084 --> 00:01:28.193
Now, the ship sank
between Robben Island to the south,

00:01:28.217 --> 00:01:30.567
and Dassen Island to the north --